{"fps": 30, "total": 45.437, "hash": "f0fd23bc0afa7766", "chapters": [], "beats": [{"id": "b001", "text": "On a quiet Tuesday evening a Citibank employee clicks a button to send a routine payment.", "start": 0.08, "end": 4.1, "words": [{"text": "On", "start": 0.08, "end": 0.18}, {"text": "a", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.24}, {"text": "quiet", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.5}, {"text": "Tuesday", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.82}, {"text": "evening", "start": 0.82, "end": 1.26}, {"text": "a", "start": 1.54, "end": 1.58}, {"text": "Citibank", "start": 1.58, "end": 1.98}, {"text": "employee", "start": 1.98, "end": 2.24}, {"text": "clicks", "start": 2.24, "end": 2.62}, {"text": "a", "start": 2.62, "end": 2.8}, {"text": "button", "start": 2.8, "end": 3.0}, {"text": "to", "start": 3.0, "end": 3.24}, {"text": "send", "start": 3.24, "end": 3.38}, {"text": "a", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.52}, {"text": "routine", "start": 3.52, "end": 3.68}, {"text": "payment.", "start": 3.68, "end": 4.1}]}, {"id": "b002", "text": "It should be about eight million dollars.", "start": 4.6584375, "end": 5.9504375, "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 4.658, "end": 4.743}, {"text": "should", "start": 4.752, "end": 4.95}, {"text": "be", "start": 4.972, "end": 5.057}, {"text": "about", "start": 5.067, "end": 5.236}, {"text": "eight", "start": 5.255, "end": 5.425}, {"text": "million", "start": 5.444, "end": 5.67}, {"text": "dollars.", "start": 5.695, "end": 5.95}]}, {"id": "b003", "text": "Instead the bank wires out almost nine hundred million dollars of its own money.", "start": 7.365645833333334, "end": 11.033645833333335, "words": [{"text": "Instead", "start": 7.366, "end": 7.695}, {"text": "the", "start": 7.731, "end": 7.896}, {"text": "bank", "start": 7.914, "end": 8.12}, {"text": "wires", "start": 8.143, "end": 8.389}, {"text": "out", "start": 8.417, "end": 8.581}, {"text": "almost", "start": 8.599, "end": 8.887}, {"text": "nine", "start": 8.919, "end": 9.125}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 9.147, "end": 9.476}, {"text": "million", "start": 9.513, "end": 9.842}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 9.878, "end": 10.207}, {"text": "of", "start": 10.244, "end": 10.367}, {"text": "its", "start": 10.381, "end": 10.545}, {"text": "own", "start": 10.564, "end": 10.728}, {"text": "money.", "start": 10.746, "end": 11.034}]}, {"id": "b004", "text": "Nobody hacked anything and nobody stole a password.", "start": 11.768375, "end": 14.048375, "words": [{"text": "Nobody", "start": 11.768, "end": 12.028}, {"text": "hacked", "start": 12.028, "end": 12.268}, {"text": "anything", "start": 12.268, "end": 12.748}, {"text": "and", "start": 12.748, "end": 13.108}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 13.108, "end": 13.328}, {"text": "stole", "start": 13.328, "end": 13.568}, {"text": "a", "start": 13.568, "end": 13.728}, {"text": "password.", "start": 13.728, "end": 14.048}]}, {"id": "b005", "text": "The bank meant to send this much.", "start": 14.790354166666667, "end": 16.310354166666666, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 14.79, "end": 14.91}, {"text": "bank", "start": 14.91, "end": 15.09}, {"text": "meant", "start": 15.09, "end": 15.41}, {"text": "to", "start": 15.41, "end": 15.63}, {"text": "send", "start": 15.63, "end": 15.81}, {"text": "this", "start": 15.81, "end": 16.05}, {"text": "much.", "start": 16.05, "end": 16.31}]}, {"id": "b006", "text": "And it sent this much which is more than one hundred times too much.", "start": 16.9718125, "end": 19.6488125, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 16.972, "end": 17.113}, {"text": "it", "start": 17.129, "end": 17.234}, {"text": "sent", "start": 17.246, "end": 17.422}, {"text": "this", "start": 17.442, "end": 17.618}, {"text": "much", "start": 17.637, "end": 17.813}, {"text": "which", "start": 17.833, "end": 18.044}, {"text": "is", "start": 18.068, "end": 18.173}, {"text": "more", "start": 18.185, "end": 18.361}, {"text": "than", "start": 18.381, "end": 18.557}, {"text": "one", "start": 18.576, "end": 18.717}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 18.733, "end": 19.015}, {"text": "times", "start": 19.046, "end": 19.257}, {"text": "too", "start": 19.281, "end": 19.422}, {"text": "much.", "start": 19.437, "end": 19.649}]}, {"id": "b007", "text": "A federal judge would later call it one of the biggest blunders in banking history.", "start": 20.566291666666668, "end": 23.746291666666668, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 20.566, "end": 20.626}, {"text": "federal", "start": 20.626, "end": 20.806}, {"text": "judge", "start": 20.806, "end": 21.106}, {"text": "would", "start": 21.106, "end": 21.406}, {"text": "later", "start": 21.406, "end": 21.546}, {"text": "call", "start": 21.546, "end": 21.846}, {"text": "it", "start": 21.846, "end": 21.966}, {"text": "one", "start": 21.966, "end": 22.086}, {"text": "of", "start": 22.086, "end": 22.166}, {"text": "the", "start": 22.166, "end": 22.266}, {"text": "biggest", "start": 22.266, "end": 22.466}, {"text": "blunders", "start": 22.466, "end": 22.886}, {"text": "in", "start": 22.886, "end": 23.126}, {"text": "banking", "start": 23.126, "end": 23.306}, {"text": "history.", "start": 23.306, "end": 23.746}]}, {"id": "b008", "text": "The payment leaves at five forty five.", "start": 24.614333333333335, "end": 26.111333333333334, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 24.614, "end": 24.754}, {"text": "payment", "start": 24.77, "end": 25.051}, {"text": "leaves", "start": 25.082, "end": 25.327}, {"text": "at", "start": 25.355, "end": 25.46}, {"text": "five", "start": 25.471, "end": 25.647}, {"text": "forty", "start": 25.666, "end": 25.877}, {"text": "five.", "start": 25.9, "end": 26.111}]}, {"id": "b009", "text": "Nobody notices until the next morning.", "start": 26.691458333333333, "end": 28.411458333333332, "words": [{"text": "Nobody", "start": 26.691, "end": 26.991}, {"text": "notices", "start": 26.991, "end": 27.391}, {"text": "until", "start": 27.391, "end": 27.731}, {"text": "the", "start": 27.731, "end": 27.891}, {"text": "next", "start": 27.891, "end": 28.051}, {"text": "morning.", "start": 28.051, "end": 28.411}]}, {"id": "b010", "text": "The bank asks for the money back and some of the lenders simply say no.", "start": 28.976604166666668, "end": 32.096604166666665, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 28.977, "end": 29.037}, {"text": "bank", "start": 29.037, "end": 29.177}, {"text": "asks", "start": 29.177, "end": 29.457}, {"text": "for", "start": 29.457, "end": 29.757}, {"text": "the", "start": 29.757, "end": 29.797}, {"text": "money", "start": 29.797, "end": 29.957}, {"text": "back", "start": 29.957, "end": 30.197}, {"text": "and", "start": 30.197, "end": 30.497}, {"text": "some", "start": 30.497, "end": 30.897}, {"text": "of", "start": 30.897, "end": 30.997}, {"text": "the", "start": 30.997, "end": 31.117}, {"text": "lenders", "start": 31.117, "end": 31.317}, {"text": "simply", "start": 31.317, "end": 31.657}, {"text": "say", "start": 31.657, "end": 31.897}, {"text": "no.", "start": 31.897, "end": 32.097}]}, {"id": "b011", "text": "Almost nine hundred million dollars went out.", "start": 32.88791666666667, "end": 34.64891666666667, "words": [{"text": "Almost", "start": 32.888, "end": 33.132}, {"text": "nine", "start": 33.159, "end": 33.333}, {"text": "hundred", "start": 33.352, "end": 33.631}, {"text": "million", "start": 33.662, "end": 33.941}, {"text": "dollars", "start": 33.971, "end": 34.25}, {"text": "went", "start": 34.281, "end": 34.455}, {"text": "out.", "start": 34.475, "end": 34.649}]}, {"id": "b012", "text": "And about half a billion of it did not come back.", "start": 35.21002083333333, "end": 37.37002083333333, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 35.21, "end": 35.31}, {"text": "about", "start": 35.31, "end": 35.49}, {"text": "half", "start": 35.49, "end": 35.83}, {"text": "a", "start": 35.83, "end": 35.97}, {"text": "billion", "start": 35.97, "end": 36.19}, {"text": "of", "start": 36.19, "end": 36.43}, {"text": "it", "start": 36.43, "end": 36.57}, {"text": "did", "start": 36.57, "end": 36.73}, {"text": "not", "start": 36.73, "end": 36.91}, {"text": "come", "start": 36.91, "end": 37.15}, {"text": "back.", "start": 37.15, "end": 37.37}]}, {"id": "b013", "text": "So this is the story of the click and of who kept the money and of what the judge decided.", "start": 38.07629166666667, "end": 42.29629166666667, "words": [{"text": "So", "start": 38.076, "end": 38.256}, {"text": "this", "start": 38.256, "end": 38.536}, {"text": "is", "start": 38.536, "end": 38.676}, {"text": "the", "start": 38.676, "end": 38.796}, {"text": "story", "start": 38.796, "end": 39.056}, {"text": "of", "start": 39.056, "end": 39.256}, {"text": "the", "start": 39.256, "end": 39.356}, {"text": "click", "start": 39.356, "end": 39.476}, {"text": "and", "start": 40.056, "end": 40.096}, {"text": "of", "start": 40.096, "end": 40.216}, {"text": "who", "start": 40.216, "end": 40.356}, {"text": "kept", "start": 40.356, "end": 40.496}, {"text": "the", "start": 40.496, "end": 40.656}, {"text": "money", "start": 40.656, "end": 40.896}, {"text": "and", "start": 40.896, "end": 41.256}, {"text": "of", "start": 41.256, "end": 41.376}, {"text": "what", "start": 41.376, "end": 41.516}, {"text": "the", "start": 41.516, "end": 41.636}, {"text": "judge", "start": 41.636, "end": 41.756}, {"text": "decided.", "start": 41.756, "end": 42.296}]}, {"id": "b014", "text": "It starts at five forty five in the evening.", "start": 43.0315, "end": 44.5995, "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 43.032, "end": 43.127}, {"text": "starts", "start": 43.139, "end": 43.363}, {"text": "at", "start": 43.388, "end": 43.483}, {"text": "five", "start": 43.494, "end": 43.654}, {"text": "forty", "start": 43.672, "end": 43.864}, {"text": "five", "start": 43.885, "end": 44.044}, {"text": "in", "start": 44.062, "end": 44.159}, {"text": "the", "start": 44.169, "end": 44.297}, {"text": "evening.", "start": 44.312, "end": 44.599}]}], "gaps": []}